{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19107380","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19107380","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1910738001:1":{"text":"我听说，你找到了避免神堕的方法？","source_cn":"我听说，你找到了避免神堕的方法？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xE70619DB3C459FA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910738002:1":{"text":"是啊，坐在礁石上看鱼群迁徙时，我突然灵机一动。","source_cn":"是啊，坐在礁石上看鱼群迁徙时，我突然灵机一动。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x65C89F8BEB398F07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910738003:1":{"text":"那恐怕是只有我才能用的方法。你想知道吗？","source_cn":"那恐怕是只有我才能用的方法。你想知道吗？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xF01D2ACE699E0E06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910738004:1":{"text":"请告诉我。","source_cn":"请告诉我。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xA41901F84BBC8168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910738005:1":{"text":"你知道我的权能，我可以将自己分化成无数碎片，每一片都会...","source_cn":"你知道我的权能，我可以将自己分化成无数碎片，每一片都会...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910738006:1":{"text":"我不再是“我”，我连自己都遗忘，彻底成为另一种存在——...","source_cn":"我不再是“我”，我连自己都遗忘，彻底成为另一种存在——...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910738007:1":{"text":"等到沧海桑田，几百年后，我会在眷属的帮助下，以神明的姿...","source_cn":"等到沧海桑田，几百年后，我会在眷属的帮助下，以神明的姿...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910738008:1":{"text":"这就是你想到的方法？","source_cn":"这就是你想到的方法？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x5225F931674DB747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910738009:1":{"text":"是的，我会完全改变自己，那将是我未来存在的方式。","source_cn":"是的，我会完全改变自己，那将是我未来存在的方式。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x16EBA9C1F16CF825","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910738010:1":{"text":"避免神堕，就没有兵戈相见的理由。虽然此后相隔数百年才能...","source_cn":"避免神堕，就没有兵戈相见的理由。虽然此后相隔数百年才能...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910738011:1":{"text":"我只希望你的双手不再次被亲人的鲜血染红，亲爱的妹妹。","source_cn":"我只希望你的双手不再次被亲人的鲜血染红，亲爱的妹妹。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xA695E486C83091DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910738012:1":{"text":"但那些碎片，他们已经不再是你，他们会拥有自己的意识、情...","source_cn":"但那些碎片，他们已经不再是你，他们会拥有自己的意识、情...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910738013:1":{"text":"你让他们以为自己是独立的生命，却最终要被你的意识取代。","source_cn":"你让他们以为自己是独立的生命，却最终要被你的意识取代。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x5AD4CCBA8D7F1D8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910738014:1":{"text":"那对凡人而言是死亡，奥汐娜。在凡人的视野里，你杀了他们...","source_cn":"那对凡人而言是死亡，奥汐娜。在凡人的视野里，你杀了他们...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910738015:1":{"text":"我的碎片将有超越常人的寿命，彼此间刻入骨髓的链接，以及...","source_cn":"我的碎片将有超越常人的寿命，彼此间刻入骨髓的链接，以及...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910738016:1":{"text":"他们将幸福，友爱，不谙世事……直至最后如河流奔向海洋，...","source_cn":"他们将幸福，友爱，不谙世事……直至最后如河流奔向海洋，...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910738017:1":{"text":"亲爱的妹妹，你能明白吗？在我之前，他们不存在；在我之后...","source_cn":"亲爱的妹妹，你能明白吗？在我之前，他们不存在；在我之后...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910738018:1":{"text":"我没有创造他们，我就是他们；我也不会取代他们，他们会成...","source_cn":"我没有创造他们，我就是他们；我也不会取代他们，他们会成...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910738019:1":{"text":"对有独立意识的个体而言，这仍然和消亡毫无区别。","source_cn":"对有独立意识的个体而言，这仍然和消亡毫无区别。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x60DD08D322C2B32B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910738020:1":{"text":"那么，你要屠杀成千上万还未来得及诞生的生命，以及……我吗？","source_cn":"那么，你要屠杀成千上万还未来得及诞生的生命，以及……我吗？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x30D4175CE72C6BFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910738021:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910738022:1":{"text":"你犹豫了！无论如何，这都是一种方法。","source_cn":"你犹豫了！无论如何，这都是一种方法。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F40DE570D96DFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910738023:1":{"text":"如果此举真能避免神堕的话，妹妹，也许你也可以受到启发，...","source_cn":"如果此举真能避免神堕的话，妹妹，也许你也可以受到启发，...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910738024:1":{"text":"你觉得我也会迎来神堕的命运？","source_cn":"你觉得我也会迎来神堕的命运？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xBAE344572DC735CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910738025:1":{"text":"作为背负了原罪的神明，我觉得什么都可能发生哦？不过不要...","source_cn":"作为背负了原罪的神明，我觉得什么都可能发生哦？不过不要...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910738026:1":{"text":"什么？","source_cn":"什么？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x3C643EB1FA1741A7","variant_status":"adjacent_same_source_target_same","male":"什么？","female":"什么？","variant_male_record_index":"84111","variant_female_record_index":"84112","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1910738027:1":{"text":"我知道你在找能真正实行自己权能的方法，亲爱的妹妹。","source_cn":"我知道你在找能真正实行自己权能的方法，亲爱的妹妹。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x0DEE5BF48E4DC9DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910738028:1":{"text":"你没能完全封闭自己的心，夺去同胞生命的罪行在给你的灵魂...","source_cn":"你没能完全封闭自己的心，夺去同胞生命的罪行在给你的灵魂...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910738029:1":{"text":"而不管你曾经做过什么，我都是你的姐姐——永远是你的姐姐...","source_cn":"而不管你曾经做过什么，我都是你的姐姐——永远是你的姐姐...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1910738030:1":{"text":"作为回报，这次可以听听我的愿望吗？","source_cn":"作为回报，这次可以听听我的愿望吗？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xB05566A62C6FD9C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1910738031:1":{"text":"请说吧，奥汐娜，我不保证会全然应允，但只论当下，我可以...","source_cn":"请说吧，奥汐娜，我不保证会全然应允，但只论当下，我可以...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1910738032:1":{"text":"你会答应的，妹妹，因为我了解你！","source_cn":"你会答应的，妹妹，因为我了解你！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x33BD2E44F7ACC827","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1910738033:1":{"text":"在我重新聚合复苏的时候，爆发的神力会使深海沸腾，浅海死...","source_cn":"在我重新聚合复苏的时候，爆发的神力会使深海沸腾，浅海死...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1910738034:1":{"text":"我的愿望是：当复苏发生时，你能代替我，去为陆地沿岸提供庇护。","source_cn":"我的愿望是：当复苏发生时，你能代替我，去为陆地沿岸提供庇护。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xDE462F55F9BF129B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1910738035:1":{"text":"……我无法理解你，奥汐娜，你想创造并抹杀一个种族，但与...","source_cn":"……我无法理解你，奥汐娜，你想创造并抹杀一个种族，但与...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1910738036:1":{"text":"你在意凡人，所以我会在意凡人。当然，我更会爱我自己。","source_cn":"你在意凡人，所以我会在意凡人。当然，我更会爱我自己。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xB973D451972AA0CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1910738037:1":{"text":"就连神明也可以发生变化，我亲爱的妹妹。那么，你会不会改变呢？","source_cn":"就连神明也可以发生变化，我亲爱的妹妹。那么，你会不会改变呢？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x07E8EF89FD4DA706","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"",